    "['opcode [parameter1] end', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols source-packet-routing srgb index-range start 1 end 1', 'parent_command': ['set protocols isis interface [parameter1]', 'set protocols source-packet-routing srgb start-label 2001:db8:15:: end-label 2001:db8:15::ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff'], 'root': 'set protocols isis interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI `opcode ::1 end` command for Segment Routing IPv6:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing srgb index-range start 1 end 1\\n##\\n\\nOr more precisely for the opcode mapping:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing segment-list my-list segment-1 end\\n##\\n\\nNote: Juniper\\'s implementation differs slightly as it doesn\\'t use the same opcode syntax. The closest equivalent would be configuring an end segment (which represents the same function as HUAWEI\\'s \"end\" opcode) in a segment list. The exact implementation might vary based on Junos version and specific SRv6 requirements.', 'trans_template': 'set protocols source-packet-routing srgb index-range start 1 end 1'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols source-packet-routing segment-list my-list segment-1 end', 'parent_command': ['set protocols isis interface [parameter1]', 'set protocols source-packet-routing srgb start-label 2001:db8:15:: end-label 2001:db8:15::ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff'], 'root': 'set protocols isis interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the Juniper equivalent of the HUAWEI `opcode ::1 end` command for Segment Routing IPv6:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing srgb index-range start 1 end 1\\n##\\n\\nOr more precisely for the opcode mapping:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing segment-list my-list segment-1 end\\n##\\n\\nNote: Juniper\\'s implementation differs slightly as it doesn\\'t use the same opcode syntax. The closest equivalent would be configuring an end segment (which represents the same function as HUAWEI\\'s \"end\" opcode) in a segment list. The exact implementation might vary based on Junos version and specific SRv6 requirements.', 'trans_template': 'set protocols source-packet-routing segment-list my-list segment-1 end'}]]": 1,
    "['opcode [parameter1] end-dt4 vpn-instance [parameter2]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set protocols source-packet-routing srv6 locator as1 end-dt4-sid 100 vpn-instance vpna', 'parent_command': ['set protocols isis interface [parameter1]', 'set protocols source-packet-routing srgb start-label 2001:db8:15:: end-label 2001:db8:15::ffff:ffff:ffff:ffff'], 'root': 'set protocols isis interface [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the translated Juniper equivalent command for the Huawei SRv6 opcode configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset protocols source-packet-routing srv6 locator as1 end-dt4-sid 100 vpn-instance vpna\\n##\\n\\nThis Juniper command:\\n1. Creates an End.DT4 SID (::100 in Huawei) with value 100\\n2. Associates it with the VPN instance \"vpna\"\\n3. Places it under the SRv6 locator \"as1\"\\n4. Uses the same function (End.DT4) for VPNv4 decapsulation\\n\\nThe Juniper syntax follows its hierarchical configuration style while preserving the same functionality as the Huawei command.', 'trans_template': 'set protocols source-packet-routing srv6 locator as1 end-dt4-sid 100 vpn-instance vpna'}]]": 1,
